{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/8.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more people wishlist the game, the more content there will be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/7.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/1.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your destiny in &quot;Becoming a King&quot;, an exciting time management romance game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Becoming a King&quot;, you will go from humble beginnings to a powerful monarch. Manage your time, make life-changing decisions, and deserve to become a king! Intrigues, romantic stories, and complex dilemmas will define the future of your dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/2.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc95 Seven charming and unique girls to romance <br>\ud83e\udd1d Strengthening not only romantic ties but also friendships <br>\u23f3 Exciting time management mechanics <br>\ud83d\udcd6 Fascinating storyline <br>\ud83c\udfae Additional activities in the form of mini games and rouge like battle system <br>\ud83c\udfac Cut Scenes and Cards for Successful Romantic Relationships <br>\u2696\ufe0f Character-based choice system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/Explore.gif?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every step you take affects the history of the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/Choose.gif?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/3.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc99 Bright and charismatic heroines, each with their own story and character <br>\ud83d\udc99 An opportunity to win the heart of your chosen one and build a dynasty. <br>\ud83d\udc99 Unpredictable events that reveal the royal court's secrets <br>\ud83d\udc99 Unique gifts and romantic dates <br>\ud83d\udc99 Challenges to test the strength of your feelings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcab Choose your future queen and write your love story!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/4.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/5.png?t=1745231723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What kind of king will you become? Can you solve the mystery of your parents' death? Will you find your love? Every decision you make will affect your future, so choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/extras/6.png?t=1745231723\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597020?t=1745231723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/b1029747d9815091bd69225f7edf6bda26749df4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745231723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/694c63670e4e09b5e2f84fa53fcfdb73a16b7d16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745231723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597020/694c63670e4e09b5e2f84fa53fcfdb73a16b7d16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745231723","ca